NotoColorEmoji.ttf: Noto Color Emoji 2.042 (CBDT), copied from gpui-mobile's
example app. SIL Open Font License 1.1, https://openfontlicense.org.
Android 13+ ships only a COLRv1 emoji font, which gpui-mobile cannot draw; it
falls back to this asset.

The committed NotoColorEmoji.ttf is a modified copy: the upstream file went through
`emoji::import` (src/emoji.rs), which appends a `name` table (family "Noto Color Emoji",
PostScript "NotoColorEmoji") and a `cmap` with a Latin 'm', so requesting the family keeps it.
Noto Color Emoji has no Reserved Font Name, so the name stays. Made with:
MAKE_BUNDLED_SRC=<upstream.ttf> MAKE_BUNDLED_OUT=<existing dir> cargo test --lib make_bundled_font -- --ignored
and the file `emoji-font` there copied over this one. The test the_bundled_font_is_ready_to_be_requested checks it.
